# Step 6: BUILD — Implementation

## Objective
Implement TIPs in dependency order, running tests after each.

## Rules
- Each Python script < 200 LOC
- Each MQL5 Include < 200 LOC
- No master /mql5 router
- No dead code from VCK-HU (query_loop, tool_executor, intent_router)
- Run `pytest tests/` after each TIP
- Run `mql5-lint` on every new .mq5 file

## Checklist per TIP
- [ ] Code implemented
- [ ] Unit tests written
- [ ] Lint passes
- [ ] LOC verified < ceiling
- [ ] Anti-drift audit passes
